# Route: guide 45 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 59, 52 quests, 1.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stormwind City, Elwynn Forest, Wetlands, Eastern Plaguelands): near
# Stormwind City -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind ->
# Stormwind -> near Stormwind -> near Stormwind City -> Stormwind -> near
# Stormwind City -> Northshire Valley -> Eastvale Logging Camp -> Menethil
# Harbor -> Black Channel Marsh -> ….
#
# Left out: Morganth (249): the route takes them here but cannot finish them
# (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
# Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391),
# The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault
# (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample
# (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489), The Fury
# Runs Deep (378), The Fury Runs Deep (378), Lost in the Thicket Things
# (95647), Fallen in the Fen (95795), Heartwoven (95809), Highland Hides
# (98815), Highland Hides (98815), Prehistoric Prism (98824), Prehistoric
# Prism (98824), Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945),
# Anthion's Old Friend (8948).

